<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>If new credit card holders need to be added to the database, collect the following information before filling in the new cardholder form.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Name of cardholder (as it appears on the cards)</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Which cards do they have?  M/C, VISA or both?</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Credit limit</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Maximum purchase per order (currently $5,000)</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Maximum credit per month (same as credit limit)</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To add the new card holder:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  In the Admin area, select Card Holders from the navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Click on the New Cardholder button on the action bar.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%'/>
